# Title: AWS VPC Flow Logs Deleted
# ID: e386b9b5-af12-450e-afff-761730fb8a98
# Status: experimental
# Level: high
# Author: Ivan Saakov
# Date: 2025-10-19
# Tags: attack.stealth
# Description: Detects the deletion of one or more VPC Flow Logs in AWS Elastic Compute Cloud (EC2) through the DeleteFlowLogs API call.
# Adversaries may delete flow logs to evade detection or remove evidence of network activity, hindering forensic investigations and visibility into malicious operations.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((eventName="DeleteFlowLogs") AND ((NOT errorCode=*) OR (errorCode="Success")))
